OL,3,AStifling heat and broken toilets: TUI
OL,4,ARiver Cruise passengers tell of their
OL,5,Aholiday hell
OL,6,
OL,7,FDozens of people have accused TUI River
OL,8,FCruises of operating vessels with
OL,9,Ffaulty facilities including
OL,10,Fpersistently broken air conditioning,
OL,11,Fafter they spent thousands of pounds on
OL,12,Fholidays.
OL,14,FEarlier this year passengers on the
OL,15,FSkyla, a ship operated by TUI,
OL,16,Fcontacted BBC Your Voice to say they
OL,17,Fhad been stranded in Budapest during a
OL,18,Fheatwave with little to no air
OL,19,Fconditioning.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,119,105,200,300,0,100
